    MARKUS "E devemos nossas vidas àquelas coisas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:38
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_c24ddfec:

    # MC @ talk "Markus, we have no actual idea of what’s going on with us!"
    MC @ talk "Markus, não temos a menor ideia do que está acontecendo conosco!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:39
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a83dacb2:

    # MARKUS "And we’re not ever going to know if we don’t at least try to understand them!"
    MARKUS "E nunca vamos saber se não tentarmos ao menos entendê-los!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:40
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_1a988a98:

    # MARKUS "We have to give them a chance."
    MARKUS "Temos que dar uma chance a eles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:41
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_32d97cab:

    # MARKUS "If what those {i}things{/i} told us is true, this is the only way."
    MARKUS "Se o que aquelas {i}coisas{/i} nos disseram for verdade, este é o único caminho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:49
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_f86ed6dc:

    # "As we passed through the city gate, I felt all kinds of distressing thoughts popping in and out of existence."
    "Enquanto passávamos pelo portão da cidade, senti todo tipo de pensamentos angustiantes surgindo e desaparecendo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:51
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_83b48436:

    # MC "(What are we doing? Will whatever Markus has in mind work? What exactly is going to happen to us now? Is there a 'cure' or something?)"
    MC "(O que estamos fazendo? O que quer que Markus tenha em mente vai funcionar? O que exatamente vai acontecer conosco agora? Existe uma 'cura' ou algo assim?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:53
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_f7d13ea9:

    # "Confident, Markus simply began making his way towards the expanse of the desert."
    "Confiante, Markus simplesmente começou a seguir em direção à vastidão do deserto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:54
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_7424c0b1:

    # MARKUS "Keep up, [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "Acompanhe, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:55
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_6cc0ac7f:

    # MC "Snapping out of it, I followed Markus."
    MC "Voltando a mim, segui Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:64
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_4a46d39e:

