    # MC @ talk "How will we explain to anyone what we were doing beyond the walls?"
    MC @ talk "Como vamos explicar a alguém o que estávamos fazendo além das muralhas?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:66
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_832fb5ad:

    # MARKUS "Easy, we’re part of the Adventurer’s Guild now, remember? Just say we were patrolling for enemies or whatever..."
    MARKUS "Fácil, somos parte da Guilda dos Aventureiros agora, lembra? Só diga que estávamos patrulhando em busca de inimigos ou algo assim..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:67
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_be0c9c6e:

    # MARKUS "Come on, as long as we’re out of view of the wall it should be safe enough for us."
    MARKUS "Vamos, desde que estejamos fora da vista da muralha, deve ser seguro o suficiente para nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:68
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_78360619:

    # MC @ talk "As long as we don’t get clawed or bitten or disembowelled by some passing Demorai..."
    MC @ talk "Contanto que não sejamos arranhados, mordidos ou estripados por algum Demorai de passagem..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:69
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_c0c49e59:

