# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:107
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_10213d19:

    # "Clamping my eyes shut, I tried to reach deep into myself, thinking about changing into... whatever I was supposed to be changing into."
    "Fechando os olhos com força, tentei me aprofundar em mim mesmo, pensando em me transformar no... seja lá no que eu deveria estar me transformando."

