    # "Markus suddenly bent double, clutching at his stomach as he gasped for air."
    "Markus de repente se dobrou ao meio, segurando o estômago enquanto ofegava por ar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:114
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_7e498c11:

    # MC @ talk "Markus... I can feel—"
    MC @ talk "Markus... posso sentir—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:117
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_06af2d05:

    # "A sharp pain coursed through me and I screamed like a man possessed."
    "Uma dor aguda percorreu-me e gritei como um homem possuído."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:118
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_909046ac:

    # "I felt my bones shatter in quick succession and then form again, the broken pieces growing, becoming larger, stronger."
    "Senti meus ossos se estilhaçarem em rápida sucessão e depois se formarem novamente, os pedaços quebrados crescendo, tornando-se maiores, mais fortes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:119
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_235205d7:

    # "The pain forced me to my knees, and I let out a roar of agony as I felt my spine elongating before the pain travelled to my head and my mind cracked."
    "A dor me forçou a me ajoelhar, e soltei um rugido de agonia quando senti minha coluna se alongar antes que a dor viajasse para minha cabeça e minha mente se partisse."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:120
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0d94ada9:

    # "Fragments of my thoughts were being melded with the symbiote; I could feel its long fingers on the inside of my skull as it picked through my mind."
    "Fragmentos dos meus pensamentos estavam sendo fundidos com o simbionte; eu podia sentir seus longos dedos dentro do meu crânio enquanto vasculhava minha mente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:121
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_fdf206a5:

    # "My whole body burned as I felt it mould and shape itself to me, creating a monstrous new form."
    "Meu corpo inteiro queimava enquanto eu sentia ele se moldar e se ajustar a mim, criando uma nova forma monstruosa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:122
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a01885fa:

    # "Somewhere on the edge of my vision I could see Markus lying on the floor, his head in his hands, screaming."
    "Em algum lugar na periferia da minha visão, eu via Markus deitado no chão, com a cabeça entre as mãos, gritando."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:123
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_85ca6baf:

    # "Any hopes of it being a painless transformation were thwarted as the agonising ordeal continued."
    "Qualquer esperança de que fosse uma transformação indolor foi frustrada enquanto a provação agonizante continuava."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:124
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_9f8d681b:

    # "Finally, as I felt strange snake like creatures force their way out of my back, I stood upright to stare at Markus... or at least... what I {i}knew{/i} was Markus."
    "Finalmente, enquanto sentia estranhas criaturas parecidas com cobras forçarem seu caminho para fora das minhas costas, fiquei de pé para encarar Markus... ou pelo menos... o que eu {i}sabia{/i} que era Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:130
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_d689ad14:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]... we’re..."
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]... nós estamos..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:131
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_4fdfcee7:

    # "His voice was distorted, {i}inhuman{/i}."
    "Sua voz estava distorcida, {i}desumana{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:132
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_2a306dbb:

    # "I gawped down at my clawed hands and then towards the slither of one of my tentacles as it slid over my shoulder and turned to look at me inquisitively before retreating."
    "Olhei boquiaberto para minhas mãos com garras e então para o deslizar de um dos meus tentáculos enquanto ele deslizava sobre meu ombro e se virava para me olhar inquisitivamente antes de recuar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:133
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0cfb0550:

    # "Curiously, Markus did not possess any of the strange tentacles that protruded from my back, but instead, large white wings that kicked up the hot sand as they beat ferociously behind him."
    "Curiosamente, Markus não possuía nenhum dos estranhos tentáculos que se projetavam das minhas costas, mas sim grandes asas brancas que levantavam a areia quente enquanto batiam ferozmente atrás dele."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:134
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_747d7458:

    # MC "How do you feel?"
    MC "Como você se sente?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:135
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_2b15eed7:

    # "It seemed both of our voices had changed to be more guttural, but they were clear enough to understand."
    "Parecia que ambas as nossas vozes haviam mudado para serem mais guturais, mas eram claras o suficiente para entender."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:136
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_209f5300:

