    MARKUS "Pergunto-me..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:145
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_3d171ada:

    # "Markus sprinted forward, launching himself into the air as his wings lifted him off the ground."
    "Markus correu para a frente, lançando-se no ar enquanto as suas asas o elevavam do chão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:146
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a1321702:

    # "With an elated cry of joy, he called to me to keep up with him."
    "Com um grito exultante de alegria, ele chamou-me para o acompanhar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:149
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0c33d2bc:

    # "Chasing him like some great bird in the sky, I found instinctively that sprinting after him on all fours meant that I could achieve speeds faster than any human could ever hope to."
    "Perseguindo-o como um grande pássaro no céu, descobri instintivamente que correr atrás dele de gatas significava que eu conseguia alcançar velocidades mais rápidas do que qualquer humano poderia alguma vez esperar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:151
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_71005e1e:

    # "Suddenly, my tentacles slammed into the ground, throwing me along in steady motions as we crossed huge swathes of land in no time."
    "De repente, meus tentáculos bateram no chão, me impulsionando em movimentos constantes enquanto cruzávamos vastas extensões de terra em pouco tempo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:152
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_42c07e27:

    # "Finally, I caught up to Markus and the two of us settled down to catch our breath."
    "Finalmente, alcancei Markus e nós dois paramos para recuperar o fôlego."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:157
translate ptPT qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_662e09b6:

